someone like that,

00:08:37.249 --> 00:08:39.685
even though Rudy is facing
a mountain of legal bills

00:08:39.685 --> 00:08:41.921
because he did
Trump's dirty work.

00:08:41.921 --> 00:08:44.056
Among as many
other legal problems,

00:08:44.056 --> 00:08:46.024
Rudy is also being sued
for defamation

00:08:46.024 --> 00:08:48.427
by the election technology
firm Dominion,

00:08:48.427 --> 00:08:49.928
the same company
that's also suing

00:08:49.928 --> 00:08:51.931
MyPillow CEO Mike Lindell

00:08:51.931 --> 00:08:53.832
for spreading insane lies
about the election.

00:08:53.832 --> 00:08:56.568
Lindell, you might recall,
is so crazy,

00:08:56.568 --> 00:08:58.170
he got kicked out of a meeting

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:01.073
of the Republican
Governors Association

00:09:01.073 --> 00:09:04.910
and, at an event yesterday that
he billed as a Cyber Symposium,

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:06.745
Lindell spent a considerate
amount of time

00:09:06.745 --> 00:09:10.049
complaining about how he got
kicked out of that meeting.

00:09:10.049 --> 00:09:11.316 line:0%
-If y'all remember,
I got kicked out

00:09:11.316 --> 00:09:13.252 line:0%
of the Republican
Governors Convention

00:09:13.252 --> 00:09:15.421 line:0%
because Doug Ducey
and Brian Kemp

00:09:15.421 --> 00:09:16.822 line:0%
were afraid I would talk to 'em.

00:09:16.822 --> 00:09:18.424 line:0%
I was invited there.

00:09:18.424 --> 00:09:20.826 line:0%
Now, we're going to talk
about the terrible media.

00:09:20.826 --> 00:09:22.595 line:0%
I was invited
to that convention.

00:09:22.595 --> 00:09:24.130 line:0%
Here's the real story behind it.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:25.731 line:0%
I get down there.
I got my things.

00:09:25.731 --> 00:09:28.133 line:0%
We're all going to head
to the governor's mansion

00:09:28.133 --> 00:09:30.202 line:0%
and a guy comes out
and he goes, "Mike,

00:09:30.202 --> 00:09:31.203 line:0%
you've been kicked out,"

00:09:31.203 --> 00:09:32.805 line:0%
and he goes,
"You've been uninvited."

00:09:32.805 --> 00:09:34.239 line:0%
I said, "What do you mean?"

00:09:34.239 --> 00:09:37.109 line:0%
He goes, "Something to do
with Brian Kemp and Doug Ducey."

00:09:37.109 --> 00:09:39.077 line:0%
Well, and I said,
"The whole event?"

00:09:39.077 --> 00:09:40.679 line:0%
He said,
"Yeah, the whole event."

00:09:40.679 --> 00:09:41.881
-Everything about that
is perfect.

00:09:41.881 --> 00:09:43.816
I especially love
that he wanted to clarify

00:09:43.816 --> 00:09:46.152
if he'd been kicked out
of the whole event,

00:09:46.152 --> 00:09:47.820
as opposed to just getting
kicked out of part of it,

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.655
and I bet that's not
the first time it happened.

00:09:49.655 --> 00:09:52.224
[ As Lindell ]
I once got kicked out
of the quiet car on Amtrak

00:09:52.224 --> 00:09:54.293
and said,
"Can I go to a regular car?"

00:09:54.293 --> 00:09:56.161
They said, "You got to go
to the loud car."

00:09:56.161 --> 00:09:57.162
Then, they opened the door

00:09:57.162 --> 00:09:58.964
and they pushed me
out of the train.

00:09:58.964 --> 00:10:00.800
[ Laughter ]
But I just hit the tracks

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.735
and I bounced right back up.

00:10:02.735 --> 00:10:05.070
[ Laughter ]
Also, in what way was this

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:07.072
a cyber symposium?

00:10:07.072 --> 00:10:09.241
From what I can tell,
he spent a lot of the time

00:10:09.241 --> 00:10:11.376
complaining about getting
kicked out of other events.

00:10:11.376 --> 00:10:13.445
Imagine going to see a man

00:10:13.445 --> 00:10:17.015
who admits this is the only room
he's been allowed to stay in

00:10:17.015 --> 00:10:19.518
and then, imagine
if he was also asked

00:10:19.518 --> 00:10:22.054
to leave that room,
and then refused.

00:10:22.054 --> 00:10:23.622 line:0%
-They attacked me.

00:10:23.622 --> 00:10:25.690 line:0%
They buried it.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:28.927 line:0%
You think about that.

00:10:28.927 --> 00:10:31.163 line:0%
-They got something they want
to show you offstage here.

00:10:31.163 --> 00:10:33.299 line:0%
-Okay, I guess we have
something offstage.

00:10:33.299 --> 00:10:35.700 line:0%
So, we're livestreaming, though.

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.436 line:0%
So, you want to talk?

00:10:37.436 --> 00:10:38.504 line:0%
-I think we're going to --

00:10:38.504 --> 00:10:40.239 line:0%
I think we're set up for a break

00:10:40.239 --> 00:10:41.740 line:0%
and maybe we're going
to talk a little bit.

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:43.576 line:0%
Right when we get back there,
we're going to go into --

00:10:43.576 --> 00:10:45.077 line:0%
-No, we're not going on a break.

00:10:45.077 --> 00:10:46.078 line:0%
Put up that movie again.

00:10:46.078 --> 00:10:47.579 line:0%
Run the movie.
There's no breaks.

00:10:47.579 --> 00:10:49.315 line:0%
We're streaming 72 hours,

00:10:49.315 --> 00:10:51.550 line:0%
livestreaming,
so, around the world.

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:53.218 line:0%
This never stops.

00:10:53.218 --> 00:10:54.453 line:0%
You guys can go eat.

00:10:54.453 --> 00:10:55.821 line:0%
That's fine, but I ain't eating.
-[ Laughs ]

00:10:55.821 --> 00:10:57.923 line:0%
-I'm staying up here
for 72 hours

00:10:57.923 --> 00:10:59.491 line:0%
before they ruin our signal.

00:10:59.491 --> 00:11:00.759
[ Laughter ]
-Amazing. First,

00:11:00.759 --> 00:11:02.861
he got kicked out of the
Republican Governors Convention,

00:11:02.861 --> 00:11:07.133
and then, they tried to drag him
out of his own Cyber Symposium.

00:11:07.133 --> 00:11:09.167
Next, they're going to kick him
off the board of MyPillow.

00:11:09.167 --> 00:11:10.336
"Mike, we're just not sure

00:11:10.336 --> 00:11:12.037
a guy who says he's going to

00:11:12.037 --> 00:11:14.707
stay up and livestream for three
days straight without breaks

00:11:14.707 --> 00:11:16.809
is a guy you want
to buy a pillow from."

00:11:16.809 --> 00:11:18.210
[ As Lindell ]
I can't sleep, anyway.

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:21.280
MyPillow is filled
with fire ants and broken glass.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:25.217
Now, let me get out there,
so I can talk about cy-bear.

00:11:25.217 --> 00:11:26.385
[ Laughter ]

00:11:26.385 --> 00:11:28.187
Run the movie,
"The Blues Brothers"!

00:11:28.187 --> 00:11:31.089
[ Laughter ]

00:11:31.089 --> 00:11:33.492
Also, real slick move, there,
by the other guy,

00:11:33.492 --> 00:11:34.960
to try to get him offstage --

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:37.129
"We got something to show you."

00:11:37.129 --> 00:11:38.497
[ Laughter ]
Were they trying to lure him

00:11:38.497 --> 00:11:41.867
under a box held up by a stick
like in "Looney Tunes."

00:11:41.867 --> 00:11:43.502
[ Laughter ]
"Come on, Mike. Mike, c'mere.

00:11:43.502 --> 00:11:45.204
Ooh, look, Mike.
We got something very special

00:11:45.204 --> 00:11:46.939
over here to show.
Come on, Mike!

00:11:46.939 --> 00:11:48.507
Come here.
Quick!

00:11:48.507 --> 00:11:50.041
Quick, throw the tarp on him!

00:11:50.041 --> 00:11:51.243
Strap him down!

00:11:51.243 --> 00:11:52.611
Keep your hands away
from his mouth!

00:11:52.611 --> 00:11:53.746
He will bite you!"

00:11:53.746 --> 00:11:55.113
[ Laughter ]
This has been

00:11:55.113 --> 00:11:56.682
a week of consequences

00:11:56.682 --> 00:11:58.751
for some of the most
corrupt people in politics.

00:11:58.751 --> 00:12:00.786
In Cuomo's case,
he's slinking away in disgrace

00:12:00.786 --> 00:12:03.322
after facing a reckoning
for his years of harassment,

00:12:03.322 --> 00:12:04.489
bullying, and ruthlessness.

00:12:04.489 --> 00:12:05.491
And, for Rudy and Lindell,

00:12:05.491 --> 00:12:07.192
they're finding out what happens

00:12:07.192 --> 00:12:09.127
when you debase
and humiliate yourself

00:12:09.127 --> 00:12:11.363
in service of a man
who never returns any loyalty

00:12:11.363 --> 00:12:12.431
to the people
he demands it from.

00:12:12.431 --> 00:12:14.499
Every day,
they embarrass themselves

00:12:14.499 --> 00:12:16.702
and suffer new indignities
on Trump's behalf.

00:12:16.702 --> 00:12:18.103
At this point,
Trump could order Rudy

00:12:18.103 --> 00:12:20.005
to streak naked across the field

00:12:20.005 --> 00:12:21.640
at Yankee Stadium
and Rudy would say...

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:23.308
-I would be delighted to do it.

00:12:23.308 --> 00:12:25.444
[ Chuckling ]
It can be arranged.
We can talk.

00:12:25.444 --> 00:12:27.045
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:27.045 --> 00:12:30.916
♪♪

00:12:30.916 --> 00:12:32.618
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:12:32.618 --> 00:12:33.919
over two million meals a year

00:12:33.919 --> 00:12:36.054
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:12:36.054 --> 00:12:37.589
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:12:37.589 --> 00:12:39.090
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:12:39.090 --> 00:12:41.360
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.929
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

